<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12285"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Megabyte<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Megabyte<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 26, 2005 - 12:25 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Can somebody tell me what the heck he meant by Factor X??? I wonder if I should look up the topic??? If somebody has any info on this Factor X please reply to this thread<!--/Text--></td></tr>
