<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12287"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lostdog<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lostdog<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 26, 2005 - 2:39 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dear Meg, <BR> <BR>Even Dennis Rader doesn’t know exactly what Factor X is. <BR> <BR>There have been some good guesses on this site and some bad guesses… and some hilarious ones. <BR> <BR>How do I know that?... because I’ve read all the posts. <BR> <BR>There have been twenty one separate discussions on this board regarding Factor X -- <BR>Twenty two, if we count your new thread. <BR> <BR>Twenty two! <BR> <BR>How do I know that?...check this out Meg. <BR> <BR>Go to the upper right corner of your screen. Click on search… wait! Not yet… <BR>I’ve more to share with you. <BR> <BR>The search mode on this board is a terrific tool. <BR> <BR>You’re wondering about Factor X. Try this: <BR> <BR>Enter “factor x” in the key word subject field. Make sure to use the “ ”quotation marks. They will match your query to the exact phrase. <BR> <BR>Your search results will include some brilliant discussions which will really get your juices flowing! <BR>Some of these threads are just aching for a poster to come along and reinvigorate the topic. <BR> <BR>As more truths and rumors surface, many of these old threads will live again. <BR> <BR>I have two other reasons for recommending this course of action to you. <BR> <BR>1.	Some of Catch’s best posters have… how shall I put it?… short fuses. <BR>They might be tempted to unload on you if they perceive redundancy, lack of research or, Heaven forbid… <BR>That you are trolling. <BR> <BR>It could get ugly. <BR> <BR>Unless it’s Lilymarie who takes aim. <BR>I think she’s beautiful when she’s angry! <BR> <BR>2.	I have never seen Tom Voigt’s keyboard but I’ll guarantee you this… <BR>The nomenclature is worn off of his delete key. <BR>T.V. has read every post too… and then some.  <BR>All that reading… it’s given him an itchy trigger finger. <BR>Chances are that when Tom does his spring cleaning, this thread will get… the finger! <BR> <BR>I don’t mean to discourage you from asking questions or starting threads. <BR>Lord knows, I’ve started up some duds myself. <BR>You can be sure, no one died and made me sheriff. I appreciate your enthusiasm. <BR>I just think you’ll really love that “search” feature. I use it all the time. <BR> <BR>Happy Hunting, <BR> <BR>Xdog <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
