<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12463"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tallulabay<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tallulabay<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->3-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 31, 2005 - 12:28 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I agree, Rader would not harrass the media unless he wanted to get caught, supplied enough to get caught,knowing the techicalities from his own archived resources from his degree in criminal profiling. This would not only look at US history, it would look at UK and other cases as part of the finals when there was no search engines to do this. It had to be inside the news offices and archives. Therefore, he had research skills, and once you have it, you use it. Hence why the uniform, and &#39;parade&#39; in his mentality in all he does, as he inspects, so he is inspected. That closes, however, from one manic depressive dyslexic to another we can see the way our writing changes aka Zodiac and his decent into writing that is shaky, as neural meltdown. Hence the great academics on this site will see it from a text book angle and one of strong definitions which Rader will have found very funny. For he has read all those and will have used Cicero in his pontifications inside and outside church. He is however, not a scientist or psychic. Whereas,I AM. Skeptical yes, media orientated, no, for I say facts can be backed up in science as maps and geological profiling, whereas the latter cannot,but has been in 7 major murder cases as proved to the owners of this board. LE do not disclose the information given to them in  a psychic content, nor should they do so. Therefore, there is no pass mark in what the spirit guides inform of and show. Practical investigation on site is what is best in a scientific way. However, there are many co-incidences in what is shown and later coming to be known as actually happened. I do not respond to those who ask me to prove the level of psychic ability, it is enough that it is used and developed to enable others that can make use of it in that field. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
