 geological locations as that where a victim cannot possibly be, in contrast or to substantiate the behaviours. <BR> <BR>The seven cases I have looked at and been asked to on non verbal communication have since allowed new thinking with my own fellow scientists. Proof is a term for overt action. Most of my fellow  gifted persons stay in contact and do not respond to such demands. The owners yet again have had the instances which can and have been checked, so that is enough for me. However, if you or anyone else is a psychologist then I always work with those who can see another side, if they want a result. I do not claim psychic ability, one could say I am inflicted with it, others say spirit is using my knowledge of environment. So hey, lets not argue here, I did not ask for these flashes over the past 30 years, they have just come so acurate since a major accident, so learning to accept it. It would be great to boost my ego and post all that I have told Tom, but I am not going to do that. The fact is those of you have made large contributions that have become important enough for me to share with you if and when there is a breakthrough in the future. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
